text_en:
The Minister of Science and ICT shall determine and publicly notify the following matters to enhance the rights and interests of the counter party of a communications agency (hereinafter referred to as "consumers of postal savings and insurance") in concluding, soliciting, or offering to conclude a contract for postal savings and insurance policy:
Matters concerning the rights and obligations of the consumers of postal savings and insurance;
Matters to be complied with by a communications agency in order to protect the rights of the consumers of postal savings and insurance;
Other matters deemed necessary by the Minister of Science and ICT for the protection of the consumers of postal savings and insurance.
[This Article Added on Mar. 21, 2023]

