text_en:
Where a member of falls under any of the following, the Minister of Science and ICT may dismiss the relevant member: <Amended on Jul. 26, 2017; Mar. 21, 2023>
Where he or she becomes unable to perform his or her duty due to a mental or physical disability;
Where he or she is deemed unfit as a member due to neglect of duty, loss of dignity, or on any other grounds;
Where he or she is prosecuted for a criminal charge in relation to his or her duty;
Where he or she does not voluntarily recuse himself or herself from deliberation and resolution, despite falling under any subparagraph of Article 52 (1).
[This Article Added on Dec. 1, 2015]
[Moved from Article 48-4 <Mar. 21, 2023>]

